# Mobile (React Native, Expo, Flutter)

- **One toolkit per app.** Do not mix state or navigation patterns inside the same project.
- **Isolate platform differences** behind small wrappers and run both iOS and Android before a change reaches staging.
- **Every screen has loading, empty and error states.** Assume a slow or absent network; cache and retry.
- **Performance:** virtualized lists, avoid needless rebuilds and re-renders, measure on a low-end device before optimizing.
- **Secrets stay out of the bundle.** Tokens go in secure storage. Ask for a permission in context and work when it is denied.
- **Release:** CI bumps version and build number; over-the-air updates only for JavaScript-level changes.
- **Tests:** unit tests for logic, component or widget tests for screens, one E2E smoke test on the critical path.
